# What the .vsix must NOT carry.
#
# The extension host runs one file — `dist/extension.js`, the esbuild bundle of
# `src/` plus the CLI pipeline it imports. Shipping `src/` too would put a
# second copy of the same code in the package, and the copy nobody runs is the
# one that drifts. The source stays readable where it is readable: the repo,
# and the unminified npm tarball the CLI ships.
src/**
**/*.test.*
**/*.map
**/tsconfig*.json
node_modules/**
.gitignore

# The icon SOURCE. `icon.png` is what the Marketplace renders; this is the SVG
# it was rasterised from, kept in the repo so the PNG can be regenerated and
# checked against `lib/mark.ts` by `lib/one-logo.guardrail.test.ts`.
icon.svg
